overview\":\"Pakistan-born comedian Kumail Nanjiani and grad student Emily Gardner fall in love but struggle as their cultures clash. When Emily contracts a mysterious illness, Kumail finds himself forced to face her feisty parents, his family's expectations, and his true feelings.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":437018,\"title\":\"Gad Gone Wild\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fyI6JwiT79rfI41ql7hfDmCD3uz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y5O6XKmUjblLZvBPxpVdcoohN2p.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"French comic Gad Elmaleh regales a Montreal crowd with tales of awkward mix-ups and baffling customs he's encountered since moving to the U.S.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1628443,\"title\":\"Laurent Paquin - Crocodile Distrait\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qDitpAlOK2bVKKJMdPK5mXZCh2G.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1255883,\"title\":\"Alex Edelman: Just for Us\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kUFBY1vF4sCHVTv1Oy9s23269Or.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x7FvGNMA451hCIGTS23x98midnc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the wake of a string of anti-Semitic threats pointed in his direction online, Edelman decides to go straight to the source; specifically, Queens, where he covertly attends a meeting of White Nationalists and comes face-to-face with the people behind the keyboards.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1631346,\"title\":\"Roman Frayssinet : Ô delà\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jeFY9hrchhHwZ8cvenu2H0FIvUC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cCyPeisTrGlcsFTjeRJE4XV03iM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After venturing “Ô dedans”, the second installment of Roman Frayssinet’s trilogy of shows invites us to go “Ô delà” —to step back and observe life from a distance in order to make peace with it. It’s a new, funny, and surreal journey during which Roman Frayssinet casts his gaze upon the world in search of nuance, beauty, balance, and above all, laughter.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":282861,\"title\":\"Dieudonné - Le Mur\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7oiRPAcfsypcDNV49yl8l6iZo97.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1TIqZyeujFiput3c9LInB3nU649.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":494354,\"title\":\"Olivier De Benoist : 0-40 Ans\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iyjd0a2kAdzLT33bqmHH14FznDL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/96cJa33AJ8CJQQKu20TCDwiq5Dw.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After two shows where he delighted his audience with (falsely) misogynistic reflections, Olivier de Benoist returns to the stage, this time decided not to attack women anymore. Finally, less than usual ... With 0/40 years old, where he tells his life from birth to today, the humorist wanted to abandon the macho character who had made his success. But for lack of common thread and inventive staging, the show turns out to be wobbly. Not bad, certainly, with even a few good moments, but not convincing either. If the initiative was laudable, the result is likely to satisfy neither the frustrated fans of not finding everything they liked nor those who wanted to discover Olivier de Benoist in another register. Recorded in La Halle aux vins, parc des exposition, Colmar.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":26765,\"title\":\"Mr. Warmth: The Don Rickles Project\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g2s6F0KeasorYfn3UhiEmxQQJwm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xRPrWB3v3c2HUyc7f0NYV6lNtia.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The documentary consists of tape of Don's show (never been filmed before), interviews with Don's contemporaries, (Steve Lawrence, Bob Newhart, Debbie Reynolds, etc.), established comedians (Billy Crystal, Rosanna Barr, Robin Williams, Chris Rock, etc.) and young comedians (Jeff Atoll, Jimmy Kimmel, Sarah Silverman, etc.).\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":664411,\"title\":\"Franck Dubosc - Fifty / Fifty\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lNpm1GaXrgBy1rAQcc32KeEPBFK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hBBAAol6pVzFR2Pfc52ksGXWISq.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Both an eternal seducer with ocean-colored eyes and a young father doting on his two little superheroes, Franck Dubosc delivers a new show of total sincerity and unstoppable humor! \\\"I'm 50 and I love it!\\\" You too will love Franck Dubosc's \\\"Fifty Broomsticks and Dust.\\\"\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1433820,\"title\":\"Ahmed Sylla - Origami\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7kKlxgJv3fXso3TSUcIEImixL7g.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lf3u8tWwOouE60kYVeGJLAiz64L.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21429,\"title\":\"Alan Carr: Tooth Fairy Live\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dXc27Th9cEYj62GAjG06VjNBoqJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hRVuv4M8YLMuhfNRkhF3Ip8PBpo.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Alan Carr recorded this live perfomance at the Hammersmith Apollo in May 2007 to a sell-out audience. Alan talks about childhood and adolescence in his trademark frank and hilarious style.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":293178,\"title\":\"Del Shores: My Sordid Life\",\"poster\